{"id": "70653", "title": "养鬼为祸", "author": "浮梦流年", "category": "侦探推理", "count": 600, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70653/70653s.jpg", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/70/70653.htm", "intro": "我从出生前就给人算计了，五阴俱全，天生招厉鬼，懂行的先生说我活不过七岁，死后是要给人养成血衣小鬼害人的。\r\n    外婆为了救我，给我娶了童养媳，让我过起了安生日子，虽然后来我发现媳妇姐姐不是人……\r\n    从小苟延馋喘的我能活到现在，本已习惯逆来顺受，可唯独外婆被人害死了这件事。\r\n    为此，我不顾因果报应，继承了外婆养鬼的职业，发誓要把害死她的人全都送下地狱。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70653", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章：养鬼", "file": "11073290.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章：夜路", "file": "11073292.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章：童谣", "file": "11073294.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章：阴魂", "file": "11073296.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章：走尸", "file": "11073298.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章：暗算", "file": "11073300.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章：敲棺", "file": "11073302.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章：鬼债", "file": "11073304.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章：惊鬼", "file": "11073306.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章：卦算", "file": "11073308.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章：后悔", "file": "11073310.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章：死门", "file": "11073312.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章：意外", "file": "11073314.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章：阴阳", "file": "11073316.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章：始末", "file": "11073318.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章 ：逃离", "file": "11073319.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章：放养", "file": "11073321.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章：玄门", "file": "11073323.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章：魂瓮", "file": "11073325.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章：录像", "file": "11073327.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章：桃花", "file": "11073329.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章：佛心", "file": "11073331.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章：出事", "file